# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Raw and processed data are NEVER committed.
#
# Two reasons, both worth saying out loud:
#   1. The raw LendingClub file is ~1.7 GB -- it does not belong in git.
#   2. Redistribution of the raw dataset is the mirror's business, not ours.
#
# data/README.md explains exactly where to get the file and where to put it,
# so the repo stays reproducible without shipping the data.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/raw/
data/processed/
*.csv
*.parquet
!data/README.md

# Notebook / Python cruft
.ipynb_checkpoints/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
env/

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
